        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Help Seeking Among Undergraduate Men and Women in Engineering</title>\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" id=\"MathJax-script\" async\n  src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\">\n</script>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body {\n    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #fff;\n    color: #222;\n    font-size: 12px;\n  }\n  header {\n    padding: 14px 20px 10px 20px;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #ccc;\n  }\n  header h1 {\n    margin: 0 0 6px 0;\n    font-size: 22px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    color: #111;\n  }\n  header .authors {\n    color: #1a6b8a;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n  .columns {\n    display: flex;\n    width: 100%;\n    align-items: stretch;\n  }\n  .col {\n    flex: 1;\n    padding: 12px 16px;\n    border-right: 1px solid #ddd;\n  }\n  .col:last-child {\n    border-right: none;\n  }\n  .section-title {\n    color: #1a6b8a;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 12.5px;\n    margin: 10px 0 6px 0;\n  }\n  .section-title:first-child {\n    margin-top: 0;\n  }\n  p {\n    margin: 6px 0;\n    line-height: 1.35;\n    text-align: justify;\n  }\n  .quote-block {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    margin: 10px 4px;\n  }\n  .quote-mark {\n    font-size: 26px;\n    color: #999;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    line-height: 0.6;\n  }\n  .quote-mark.close {\n    align-self: flex-end;\n  }\n  .quote-text {\n    font-style: italic;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    padding: 0 6px;\n    line-height: 1.3;\n  }\n  .placeholder {\n    border: 1px dashed #999;\n    background: #fafafa;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    color: #666;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    text-align: center;\n    margin: 8px auto;\n    padding: 4px;\n  }\n  .chart-title {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    margin: 4px 0 2px 0;\n  }\n  .bar-chart-h {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 130px;\n    padding: 6px 4px;\n  }\n  .bar-row {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    margin: 3px 0;\n  }\n  .bar-label {\n    width: 78px;\n    font-size: 8.5px;\n    text-align: right;\n    padding-right: 4px;\n  }\n  .bar-track {\n    flex: 1;\n    display: flex;\n    height: 10px;\n  }\n  .bar-seg {\n    height: 100%;\n  }\n  .bar-men { background: #2f5f8f; }\n  .bar-women { background: #a9a9a9; }\n  .legend {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 8.5px;\n    margin-top: 4px;\n  }\n  .legend span { margin: 0 6px; }\n  .legend-swatch {\n    display: inline-block;\n    width: 8px;\n    height: 8px;\n    margin-right: 3px;\n    vertical-align: middle;\n  }\n  .bar-chart-v {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 150px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-end;\n    justify-content: center;\n    gap: 30px;\n    padding: 6px 10px;\n  }\n  .bar-col {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: flex-end;\n    height: 100%;\n  }\n  .bar-vert {\n    width: 34px;\n  }\n  .bar-vert.men { background: #a9d6a9; height: 40%; }\n  .bar-vert.women { background: #2f9e2f; height: 78%; }\n  .bar-col-label {\n    font-size: 9px;\n    margin-top: 3px;\n  }\n  .y-axis-labels {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    font-size: 8px;\n    color: #555;\n    width: 100%;\n  }\n  .nsf-logo {\n    width: 60px;\n    height: 60px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    margin: 10px auto 0 auto;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<header>\n  <h1>Help Seeking Among Undergraduate Men and Women in Engineering</h1>\n  <p class=\"authors\">J.W.<sup>1</sup>, J.F.<sup>1</sup>, E.P.<sup>2</sup>, and S.K.<sup>1</sup></p>\n  <p class=\"authors\" style=\"font-size:11px; color:#333;\">\n    <sup>1</sup>Carnegie Mellon University, &nbsp;&nbsp;<sup>2</sup>Tennessee Tech University\n  </p>\n</header>\n\n<div class=\"columns\">\n\n  <!-- COLUMN 1 -->\n  <div class=\"col\">\n    <div class=\"section-title\">Asking for help fosters student success</div>\n    <p>Asking for help when necessary is critical to success in the workspace, but newcomers often fear how they will be perceived when they request assistance.</p>\n    <p>Understanding factors that motivate or inhibit various groups of students from seeking help can help us understand how to <strong>design interventions that will foster student success.</strong></p>\n\n    <div class=\"quote-block\">\n      <span class=\"quote-mark\">&ldquo;</span>\n      <span class=\"quote-text\">Most of the time I'm very hesitant to go to their office. I do it, but I'm always scared that they're gonna think I'm an idiot when I walk back out.</span>\n      <span class=\"quote-mark close\">&rdquo;</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"section-title\">Women express concern about how they are perceived when seeking help</div>\n    <p>We interviewed 47 engineering undergraduates about their help-seeking strategies: 32 women and 15 men.</p>\n\n    <div class=\"chart-title\">Respondents that Expressed Fear of Being<br>Perceived as Unintelligent or Underprepared</div>\n    <div class=\"placeholder bar-chart-v\" style=\"width:100%; height:150px;\">\n      <div class=\"bar-col\">\n        <div class=\"bar-vert men\"></div>\n        <div class=\"bar-col-label\">Men</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bar-col\">\n        <div class=\"bar-vert women\"></div>\n        <div class=\"bar-col-label\">Women</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- COLUMN 2 -->\n  <div class=\"col\">\n    <div class=\"section-title\">Women report reaching out to more resources than men</div>\n\n    <div class=\"placeholder bar-chart-h\" style=\"width:100%; height:150px;\">\n      <div class=\"bar-row\">\n        <div class=\"bar-label\">Tutors/Acad. Services</div>\n        <div class=\"bar-track\"><div class=\"bar-seg bar-men\" style=\"width:8%;\"></div><div class=\"bar-seg bar-women\" style=\"width:22%;\"></div></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bar-row\">\n        <div class=\"bar-label\">Other Faculty</div>\n        <div class=\"bar-track\"><div class=\"bar-seg bar-men\" style=\"width:10%;\"></div><div class=\"bar-seg bar-women\" style=\"width:20%;\"></div></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bar-row\">\n        <div class=\"bar-label\">Teaching Assistants</div>\n        <div class=\"bar-track\"><div class=\"bar-seg bar-men\" style=\"width:35%;\"></div><div class=\"bar-seg bar-women\" style=\"width:38%;\"></div></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bar-row\">\n        <div class=\"bar-label\">Peers</div>\n        <div class=\"bar-track\"><div class=\"bar-seg bar-men\" style=\"width:55%;\"></div><div class=\"bar-seg bar-women\" style=\"width:60%;\"></div></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bar-row\">\n        <div class=\"bar-label\">Professors</div>\n        <div class=\"bar-track\"><div class=\"bar-seg bar-men\" style=\"width:45%;\"></div><div class=\"bar-seg bar-women\" style=\"width:70%;\"></div></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"legend\">\n        <span><span class=\"legend-swatch\" style=\"background:#2f5f8f;\"></span>Male</span>\n        <span><span class=\"legend-swatch\" style=\"background:#a9a9a9;\"></span>Female</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <p>Over <strong>90%</strong> of women reported using two or more resources compared to less than half the men.</p>\n    <p>Nearly <strong>30%</strong> (n=14) of the students we interviewed stated a strong preference to figure problems out themselves.</p>\n    <p>This sentiment was more commonly expressed by male students (<strong>40%</strong>) than female students (<strong>25%</strong>).</p>\n    <p>For some of our students, this independence manifested as a source of pride that <strong>prevented them from seeking help.</strong></p>\n\n    <div class=\"quote-block\">\n      <span class=\"quote-mark\">&ldquo;</span>\n      <span class=\"quote-text\">I see most of the students are boys and they are very&mdash;I don't know, maybe they get it better than I do. Sometimes I'll feel maybe embarrassed to ask them questions</span>\n      <span class=\"quote-mark close\">&rdquo;</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- COLUMN 3 -->\n  <div class=\"col\">\n    <div class=\"section-title\">Positive experiences encourage students to ask for help</div>\n    <p>Many students reported feeling more comfortable after a positive experience with an instructor who <strong>reached out</strong> to them, <strong>encouraged them,</strong> or <strong>expressed a clear passion for teaching.</strong></p>\n    <p>Students reported developing strategies for asking questions. Most commonly doing as much of the work as possible in advance in order to <strong>form specific questions.</strong></p>\n\n    <div class=\"quote-block\">\n      <span class=\"quote-mark\">&ldquo;</span>\n      <span class=\"quote-text\">I try to do all the work beforehand so I can point out to him exactly what's going wrong, and why I'm not understanding</span>\n      <span class=\"quote-mark close\">&rdquo;</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"section-title\">Seeking help should be framed as an academic competency</div>\n    <p>Students need to be persuaded that knowing when to ask for help and how to ask competently are valued life-long skills.</p>\n    <p>If students perceive asking for help effectively as an engineering competency, women and other marginalized students may experience fewer fears of stigmatization when asking questions.</p>\n\n    <div class=\"placeholder nsf-logo\" style=\"width:60px; height:60px;\">\n      [Logo:<br>NSF]\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
      },
